The note’s strategy is to “give a complete and self-contained proof of \cite[Lemma 5.1]{BHS}, thereby completing the proof of the main theorem,” because the proof in \cite{BHS} is said to be incomplete (it “relies on a result in \cite{Choudhury-Hogadi}, the proof of which contains a gap,” and “the existence of the key exact sequence … is not properly justified”). The outlined proof plan is:
