	Are there indecomposable elements in $\check{\mathcal{Z}}_*((\mathbb{Z}_2)^k)$ beyond dimension $2^k-2$?
\end{problem}

for the fully effective case and, consequently, yields a negative answer to the fully effective version of the following problem.

