	Is $\check{\mathcal{Z}}_*((\mathbb{Z}_2)^k)$ finitely generated as a $\mathbb{Z}_2$-algebra?
\end{problem}

It is important to note, however, that these elements $\alpha_m$ become decomposable in $\check{\mathcal{Z}}_*((\mathbb{Z}_2)^k)$. Therefore, the preceding problem itself remains open.

