\item First, using finite flat presentations of Rydh \cite{Rydh:2011}, reduce to descent along an \'{e}tale morphism that is finite over a closed substack.
\item Second, apply recollement arguments for triangulated categories to glue compact generators; see \Cref{prop:stacky_recollement} for a construction.
